<title>GREECE: Bomb blast wrecks Citibank offices in Athens.</title>
<headline>Bomb blast wrecks Citibank offices in Athens.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>A powerful bomb damaged a branch office of Citibank in a northern Athens suburb early on Thursday but there were no casualties, police said.</p>
<p>&quot;It was a strong blast which caused serious damage to the building but there were no injuries because the bank was closed,&quot; a police spokesman said.</p>
<p>He said no one had claimed responsibility for the blast at the bank branch in the Halandri area.</p>
</text>
